<div class="os-window__scroll settings-panel">
  <section class="settings-panel__intro">
    <span class="settings-panel__eyebrow">Desktop</span>
    <h2>Settings</h2>
    <p>调整桌面的基础观感。壁纸会保存在当前浏览器里，下次打开时继续沿用。</p>
  </section>

  <section class="settings-section">
    <div class="settings-section__header">
      <strong>Wallpaper</strong>
      <span>Choose a backdrop for the desktop, or upload one from your device.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="wallpaper-picker" role="list" aria-label="Wallpaper options">
      <button
        class="wallpaper-picker__option"
        type="button"
        data-wallpaper-option="paper"
        aria-pressed="false"
      >
        <span class="wallpaper-picker__preview wallpaper-picker__preview--paper" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="wallpaper-picker__meta">
          <strong>Paper</strong>
          <span>Warm editorial default</span>
        </span>
      </button>

      <button
        class="wallpaper-picker__option"
        type="button"
        data-wallpaper-option="dawn"
        aria-pressed="false"
      >
        <span class="wallpaper-picker__preview wallpaper-picker__preview--dawn" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="wallpaper-picker__meta">
          <strong>Dawn</strong>
          <span>Brighter cream and sand</span>
        </span>
      </button>

      <button
        class="wallpaper-picker__option"
        type="button"
        data-wallpaper-option="ink"
        aria-pressed="false"
      >
        <span class="wallpaper-picker__preview wallpaper-picker__preview--ink" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="wallpaper-picker__meta">
          <strong>Ink</strong>
          <span>Muted slate with paper light</span>
        </span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="wallpaper-upload">
      <div class="wallpaper-upload__copy">
        <strong>Custom wallpaper</strong>
        <span>Upload a JPG, PNG, or WebP image from your computer.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="wallpaper-upload__actions">
        <label class="wallpaper-upload__button" for="desktop-wallpaper-upload">Choose image</label>
        <button class="wallpaper-upload__reset" type="button" data-reset-wallpaper>Use default</button>
      </div>
      <input
        id="desktop-wallpaper-upload"
        class="wallpaper-upload__input"
        type="file"
        accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"
        data-wallpaper-upload
      />
      <div class="wallpaper-upload__status" data-wallpaper-status>No custom image selected.</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
